   "widgets_values": [
    "Equirectangular 360 degree panorama photograph (full spherical view, the left and right edges connect). Keep the original panorama exactly as it is: same composition, objects, details, colors and lighting; only subtle natural motion with minimal change from the original. Locked-off static camera, no camera movement, no zoom. The cascading stream water and foam moves: Water flows continuously down the existing rock steps, with gently renewing white foam and small ripples below each cascade. Only things physically affected by it respond gently nearby (ripples, spray, mist, stirred leaves). Everything else stays perfectly still like a photograph: rocks, ground, buildings, tree trunks, sky. Small gentle movements only, no new objects, nothing disappears. Seamless natural loop, slow, gentle movement. Same bright natural daytime sunlight with dappled shade. Photorealistic."
